      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"28\">BUILD A RESILIENT SPIRIT</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"92\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Five small practices this week</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"150\" width=\"860\" height=\"120\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#6366f1\" fill-opacity=\"0.14\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"200\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">1.</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"200\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"17\">Name the numbing behavior before you do it</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"232\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"14\">Naming ends the autopilot</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"290\" width=\"860\" height=\"120\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" fill-opacity=\"0.14\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"340\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">2.</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"340\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"17\">Sit with one hard feeling for five minutes</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"372\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"14\">No screen, no distraction</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"430\" width=\"860\" height=\"120\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" fill-opacity=\"0.14\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"480\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">3.</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"480\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"17\">Write one goal and three pathways to it</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"512\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"14\">Backup routes build real hope</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"570\" width=\"860\" height=\"120\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#10b981\" fill-opacity=\"0.14\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"620\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">4.</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"620\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"17\">Reach out to one real person, not a feed</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"652\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"14\">Connection instead of content</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"710\" width=\"860\" height=\"120\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#ec4899\" fill-opacity=\"0.14\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"760\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">5.</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"760\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"17\">Reflect in writing each night</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"792\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"14\">Did I feel it, or did I numb it first?</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Five daily moves toward resilience"
