"90\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#ffd700\" fill-opacity=\"0.1\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"715\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"18\">Neither ever asked what they wanted</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Two lives shaped by unexamined scripts"
